1
00:00:00,019 --> 00:00:01,042
Jenner did the test.

2
00:00:01,297 --> 00:00:04,210
He gave James a standard variolation, the old

3
00:00:04,255 --> 00:00:07,106
treatment that used real smallpox matter, which would

4
00:00:07,140 --> 00:00:09,544
normally cause at least a mild illness.

5
00:00:09,799 --> 00:00:10,544
Then he waited.

6
00:00:10,799 --> 00:00:11,237
One day.

7
00:00:11,492 --> 00:00:12,226
Three days.

8
00:00:12,481 --> 00:00:13,024
A week.

9
00:00:13,279 --> 00:00:14,265
Nothing happened.

10
00:00:14,520 --> 00:00:16,958
In Jenner's words, no disease followed.

11
00:00:17,213 --> 00:00:18,633
Months later, he tried again.

12
00:00:18,811 --> 00:00:19,852
Still nothing.

13
00:00:20,108 --> 00:00:21,979
The cowpox had protected the boy.

